flowchart LR
    Client["Client"] -->|POST /feedback\n{sessionId, answers[]}| FBGW["Feedback GW"] --> FBCtrl["Feedback Ctrl"]
    FBCtrl -->|score.request\n{answers[], rubricId?}| FBSvc["Feedback Svc"]
    FBSvc -->|getRubric {id or config}| RubricSvc["Rubric Svc"] --> RubricsRepo["Rubrics Repo"] --> PG["Postgres"]
    FBSvc -->|scores[], rationale| FBCtrl
    FBCtrl -->|INSERT score rows| ScoreRepo["Score Repo"] --> PG
    FBSvc -->|cache aggregates| Redis[(Redis)]
    FBSvc -.->|publish feedback.ready\n{sessionId, turnId}| MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
    FBCtrl -->|200 {scores}| FBGW --> Client
